      "text": "The reviewer attended with wife and daughter, sitting in the 400 level, and chose not to tape so they could watch the screen",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 4,
      "text": "Reviewer's only in-person Sphere show of the run; they followed the rest of the summer by phone livestream",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2024-08-08.Cancun_Mike",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Recorded with a Church Audio CA-14 omni mic, custom Bat2b modification, through stereo breakout and Rode AI Micro into an iPhone 14 Pro",
      "type": "lineage"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2024-08-08.Cancun_Mike",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Lineage: iPhone to WAV, then Reaper, then 24-bit FLAC",
      "type": "lineage"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Billed as the Finale of the Dead Forever Sphere run, with Weir, Hart, Mayer and Burbridge listed in the lineup",
      "type": "scene"
     },
